354
00:20:21,420 --> 00:20:23,340
Was soll das?

355
00:20:23,720 --> 00:20:25,240
War das alles nur Verarsche?

356
00:20:25,980 --> 00:20:27,560
Wir erklären's dir später, Tome

357
00:20:27,560 --> 00:20:29,000
